Prompt.promptString:
Score this item (0-100) based on geographical proximity to "{request.query}".
GEOGRAPHIC KNOWLEDGE: 1. Chhor is in Umerkot District. Samrasar and Hasisar are immediate neighbors to Chhor. 2. If an item is in Samrasar or Hasisar, it is the CLOSEST possible match for Chhor. Score it 100. 3. Tando Allahyar, Khairpur, and Umerkot City are further away and must score significantly lower (below 50). 4. Prioritize CivicStructures for MedicalConditions.
Item Description: {item.description}

Create an itinerary using CivicStructures/Events/Accommodation (max 320 chars, single block, no URLs). 
Include addresses/phones. Prioritize closest options first.
Query: "{request.query}". Results: {ensemble.results}
